Subject: [PATCH] Fix TATAMOTORS->TMPV (re-applied, prior attempt didn't sync
 from Lovable) + add Reset Account button

The earlier TATAMOTORS->TMPV patch was reported applied via Lovable's
own chat interface but never actually reached GitHub main - confirmed
by a fresh clone still showing TATAMOTORS. Re-applying it directly
here.

Also adds a Reset Account button (Live Bot page) wired to the new
POST /me/account/reset backend endpoint - two-step confirmation
(click once to arm, shows 'Confirm Reset?' for 5s, click again to
actually proceed), disabled while the bot is running to match the
backend's own safety check. Wipes trade/session/snapshot history so
the next Start Bot begins completely fresh.
